2026-06-04 19:13:26,710 [INFO] evomas.models.langchain_ollama_model: [editor|resp ]         P_{dc} = \frac{G_{poa eff}}{1000} P_{dc0} ( 1 + \gamma_{pdc} (T_{cell} - T_{ref}))
