2026-06-04 19:14:04,679 [INFO] evomas.models.langchain_ollama_model: [editor|resp ]     ----------
2026-06-04 19:14:07,415 [INFO] evomas.models.langchain_ollama_model: [editor|resp ]     .. [1] A. P. Dobos, "PVWatts Version 5 Manual"
